    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's listen to the sudden change of events.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Приятного аппетита.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Enjoy your meal.' A standard phrase for a waitress.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Саша, привет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sasha, hi.' A friendly greeting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Я хочу есть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to eat.' A simple statement of hunger.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Ты попросишь Калифорнию?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will you ask for a California roll?' He wants sushi.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да, конечно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, of course.' She agrees to help.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Хорошо, спасибо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay, thanks.' He is grateful for the help.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ой, что это?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, what is this?' She notices something wrong.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Человеку плохо!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A person is feeling bad!' A sudden emergency happens.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Что случилось?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened?' Panic starts to set in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Ему очень плохо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is very bad.' The situation looks serious.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Помогите!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Help!' A cry for assistance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Скорую вызовите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Call an ambulance.' A direct command to save a life.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Скорую нужно вызвать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
